w 34)\n  axis_copy                (row 35: distinct arrays, in==out aliasing, arbitrary\n                            bit patterns incl. NaN payloads - AxisCopy only copies,\n                            so use assert_vec on the raw bits)\n  project_point_on_plane   (row 36: normal = zero vector (1.0f/0.0f = inf path),\n                            axial, normalized, random, huge, NaN; dst aliasing p\n                            or normal)\n  perpendicular_vector     (row 37: src whose smallest-|component| is at index\n                            0, 1 and 2; all components >= 1 (pos stays 0); zero\n                            vector; axial; normalized; random; NaN; dst==src)\n  make_normal_vectors      (row 38: forward = axial/normalized/random/zero/NaN;\n                            plus the aliasing cases right==forward and up==forward\n                            - the C code writes right[] then reads forward[], so\n                            aliasing is observable and must match)\n  vectoangles              (row 45: x==0&&y==0 with z>0, z<0, z==+0, z==-0;\n                            x==0 with y>0 and y<0; all four atan2 quadrants; the\n                            yaw<0 and pitch<0 fix-ups; huge/tiny/inf/NaN; random)\n  rotate_point_around_vector (row 46: degrees = 0, ±90, ±180, 360, 1e30, inf, NaN;\n                            dir = axial/zero/normalized/random; point = zero/\n                            random/huge; dst aliasing dir or point)\n  rotate_around_direction  (row 47: yaw == 0.0 and -0.0 (rotation skipped) and\n                            yaw != 0; axis[0] = axial/zero/normalized/random;\n                            compare the whole 3x3 result)\n\nNotes:\n- Initialise the C and Rust output buffers to the SAME sentinel values so that\n  \"not written\" is detected.\n- These functions call sin/cos/atan2/sqrt from libm; both sides call the same\n  glibc, so results must be bit-identical.\n- Never pass values that make a `while` loop spin: none of your functions loop.\n\nWORKFLOW: write the file, then run\n  cd /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-MbXgVZ/translated_rust\n  ./build_c.sh >/dev/null && cargo build --offline 2>&1 | tail -3\n  timeout 600 cargo test --offline --test angles 2>&1 | tail -40\nIterate until it compiles. Report the final test summary, the list of test fns,\nand any divergence (exact inputs + bit patterns) WITHOUT fixing src/."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9555,"cache_read_input_tokens":205656,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9555,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf9d36cb-13a4-40a8-a93d-48ad7b006df9","uuid":"d01d7f7a-7fc0-4ee8-b2ed-c4545b5284a1","timestamp":"2026-08-20T13:43:58.611Z"}
