--------------------------------------------\n69\t\n70\t/// The angle values `AngleVectors`/`AnglesToAxis` branch on: the multiples of"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01DyAy6ZjHwM1cxNNX7xT5F5","session_id":"bf9d36cb-13a4-40a8-a93d-48ad7b006df9","uuid":"a8db175f-d732-486f-8d7f-ffcbb5653852","timestamp":"2026-08-20T14:00:47.583Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Write angle/matrix differential tests"}
